%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-coercions-functions-toboolean (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::util::Coercions
output application/json
---
{
  a: toBoolean("true"),
  b: toBoolean("false"),
  c: toBoolean("FALSE"),
  d: toBoolean("TrUe")
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "a": true,
  "b": false,
  "c": false,
  "d": true
}
